<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Assassination Rogues in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></span></h2>The set bonuses in Phase 1 are mostly the standard kind of things we've seen in the past. Our 2-set increases the damage of our primary Combo Point builder, while the 4-set increases the duration of one of our offensive cooldowns<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-14">
