<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_grimbatolraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadow Blades</span></a> by 12 seconds, which primarily just increases Combo Point generation for more finishers within our <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=79140/vendetta">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_deadliness.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vendetta</span></a> window.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
