<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">Best Assassination Rogue Trinkets in Phase 1</span></span></h2>While our absolute BiS trinkets are very easy to figure out and set in stone, it may be hard to acquire both of these or you may not have the profession mandatory for them. For this reason, we'll list both the best trinkets and a couple of alternatives that you can aim for while waiting for drops to happen.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>The best trinkets are generally the ones that best align with your big DPS cooldowns.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Active Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89082/hawkmasters-talon">
<img alt="Hawkmaster's Talon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterhorn_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hawkmaster's Talon</span></a> offers some static Agility with a Haste on-use effect on a short, 1 minute cooldown. While a decent placeholder, it doesn't stand up against the 2 Heroic trinkets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86043/jade-bandit-figurine">
<img alt="Jade Bandit Figurine" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_honoramongstthieves.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jade Bandit Figurine</span></a> is a BoE trinket that drops in the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6125/mogushan-vaults">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mogu'shan Vaults</span></a> raid. It has the exact same stats as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89082/hawkmasters-talon">
<img alt="Hawkmaster's Talon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterhorn_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hawkmaster's Talon</span></a>.</div></li></ul>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
